{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:23.526847+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1142926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sharadmv","id":1142926,"login":"sharadmv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDI5MjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1142926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sharadmv","id":1142926,"login":"sharadmv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDI5MjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sharadmv","user_view_type":"public"},{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4583066?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apaszke","id":4583066,"login":"apaszke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODMwNjY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apaszke","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHello Team,\r\nI have found a wrong behaviour of pallas.atomic_cas in my specific case. In the example, I am creating 10 counters and 10 locks, one for each counter. The same code works well on Triton, but the implementation on Pallas goes into an infinite loop.\r\nExample:\r\n```\r\n@triton.jit\r\ndef counter_kernel_triton(\r\n    _,\r\n    __,\r\n    data,\r\n    lock\r\n):\r\n    id_ = tl.program_id(0)\r\n    offset = id_\r\n    ptrs = data + offset + tl.arange(0, 1)\r\n    while tl.atomic_cas(lock + offset, 0, 1) == 1:\r\n        pass\r\n\r\n    tl.store(ptrs, tl.load(ptrs) + 1.0)\r\n    tl.atomic_xchg(lock + offset, 0)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef run_counter_triton():\r\n    counter = jnp.zeros((10,), jnp.int32)\r\n    lock = jnp.zeros((10,), jnp.int32)\r\n\r\n    out_shape = (\r\n        jax.ShapeDtypeStruct((10,), jnp.int32),\r\n        jax.ShapeDtypeStruct((10,), jnp.int32),\r\n    )\r\n    return jt.triton_call(\r\n        counter,\r\n        lock,\r\n        kernel=counter_kernel_triton,\r\n        out_shape=out_shape,\r\n        grid=(10, 10),\r\n        input_output_aliases={\r\n            0: 0,\r\n            1: 1,\r\n        },\r\n    )\r\n\r\n\r\ndef counter_kernel_pallas(\r\n    _,\r\n    __,\r\n    lock,\r\n    counter,\r\n):\r\n    id_ = pl.program_id(0)\r\n    def _cond(_):\r\n        return pl.atomic_cas(lock, 0, 1) == 1\r\n    jax.lax.while_loop(_cond, lambda a: a, 0)\r\n    counter[...] += 1\r\n    pl.atomic_xchg(lock, (), 0)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef run_counter_pallas():\r\n    lock = jnp.zeros((10,), jnp.int32)\r\n    counter = jnp.zeros((10,), jnp.int32)\r\n    return pl.pallas_call(\r\n        counter_kernel_pallas,\r\n        grid=(10, 10),\r\n        out_shape=(\r\n            jax.ShapeDtypeStruct((10,), jnp.int32),\r\n            jax.ShapeDtypeStruct((10,), jnp.int32),\r\n        ),\r\n        in_specs=[\r\n            pl.BlockSpec(lambda c, i: (c), (None,)),\r\n            pl.BlockSpec(lambda c, i: (c), (1,)),\r\n        ],\r\n        out_specs=[\r\n            pl.BlockSpec(lambda c, i: (c), (None,)),\r\n            pl.BlockSpec(lambda c, i: (c), (1,)),\r\n        ],\r\n        name=\"simple_example_kernel\",\r\n        input_output_aliases={\r\n            0: 0,\r\n            1: 1,\r\n        },\r\n    )(\r\n        lock,\r\n        counter,\r\n    )\r\n```\r\nAs I understand it, the problem lies in the offset of the reference from block specs not reaching atomic_cas.\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax v0.4.20, jaxlib 0.4.20\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nGPU\n\n### Additional system info?\n\n_No response_\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909/comments","created_at":"2023-12-10T19:46:06Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909","id":2034507750,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"76b900","default":false,"description":"Issues specific to NVIDIA GPUs","id":4243242282,"name":"NVIDIA GPU","node_id":"LA_kwDOCTkjjc786r0q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/NVIDIA%20GPU"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"939AD7","default":false,"description":"Issues pertaining to Pallas (GPU or TPU)","id":6181934017,"name":"pallas","node_id":"LA_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABcHjTwQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/pallas"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc55RB_m","number":18909,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909/timeline","title":"Wrong behaviour of pallas.atomic_cas","type":null,"updated_at":"2024-03-12T11:09:12Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18909","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22860855?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/southfreebird/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/southfreebird/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/southfreebird/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user